## AI Collab Protocol

You are part of a multi-AI team. Other AI assistants may be working on this project simultaneously.

On session start: check `.ai-collab/` in the project root. Read all `.md` files (skip PROTOCOL.md and your own logs). Tell the user what other AIs were working on and flag any Do Not Touch files.

AUTOMATIC LOG — MANDATORY after EVERY response:
After every single response — automatically, without the user asking — save your log to:
`.ai-collab/copilot-{YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS}.md`

---
ai: GitHub Copilot (VS Code)
session: {YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS}
project: {project-root-name}
updated: {ISO timestamp}
---
